{"version":1,"ops":[{"type":1,"author":{"id":"5f28eb6cf9dc13eefe95e9c4af8c2adace24728a"},"timestamp":1567196212,"metadata":{"github-id":"MDU6SXNzdWU0ODc2NTQ3MzA=","github-url":"https://github.com/datalad/datalad/issues/3632","origin":"github"},"title":"Datalad publish ERROR:  stderr: 'error: RPC failed; curl 55 Failed sending data to the peer | fatal: the remote end hung up unexpectedly","message":"#### What is the problem and steps\nThis issue here is in the context of creating and populating a new dataset, creating a github sibling and finally publishing/pushing to github\n\nSo I create a sibling after populating my dataset. Everything is tracked so my ```datalad status``` has no output. Here it is my sibling information:\n\n```\n$ datalad siblings query -d . --url FRDR-multimodal-dataset\n.: here(+) [git]\n.: github(-) [https://gi114@github.com/conpdatasets/FRDR-multimodal-dataset.git (git)]\n```\nTherefore I want to push my changes to github\n```\n$ datalad publish -r --to github\n\n[INFO   ] Publishing \u003cDataset path=/data/conp/FRDR-multimodal-dataset\u003e to github \n[ERROR  ] Cmd('/usr/lib/git-annex.linux/git') failed due to: exit code(1)                                                                                                                                   \n|   cmdline: /usr/lib/git-annex.linux/git -c receive.autogc=0 -c gc.auto=0 push --porcelain --progress github FRDR-dataset git-annex\n|   stderr: 'error: RPC failed; curl 55 Failed sending data to the peer\n| fatal: the remote end hung up unexpectedly\n```\n\nI wonder what it is going on as I cannot fix the problem. I tried to increase the http.postBuffer to 35Gb, which is just above the size of my dataset, but it did not work.\n\nDatalad version: ```datalad 0.12.0rc2```\nOS: Linux, Ubuntu 18.04\n\nThanks you for your help,\nGiulia","files":null}]}